                Step 3: Equate powers.

                Mass: −a + b = 0, so b = a.

                Time: −2a − b − d = 0, so d = −2a − b = −3a.

                Length: 3a + 2b + d = 1. Substituting b = a and d = −3a: 3a + 2a − 3a = 2a = 1, so a = 1/2.

